  m_Name: Note_Hallway1Segment2
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::NoteData
  title: 'SECURITY NOTICE: B-Wing Access Restriction'
  author: Dexter Greenfield
  body: 'NEXUS INSTITUTE -- SECURITY DIVISION


    NOTICE: B-WING CORRIDOR ACCESS
    SUSPENDED


    Effective immediately, staff access to B-Wing is suspended

    pending
    a scheduled systems review.

    Please use the C-Wing corridor as an alternate
    route.


    This action has been authorised under ARBITEX Facility

    Management
    Protocol. No further details are available at this time.


    If you require
    urgent access to B-Wing, contact the Security Desk.


    Security Division

    Dexter
    Greenfield'
  noteType: 0
